# Google Maps Platform API Key (used by client Map / Places UI and Next.js Route Handlers)
# Never commit .env.local or hardcode a real API key in source control.
#
# Quickstart (Free, zero-billing prototyping):
# 1. Visit https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your free Maps Demo Key (supports Maps JS, Places, Routes, Geocoding).
# 4. Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key below:
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional separate server-only key for Next.js Route Handlers (/api/places/*, /api/routes/*).
# If omitted, Route Handlers fall back to NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY.
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_server_google_maps_api_key_here
